      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Errors – best practice:\nvalidate data first,\nthen check if it exists\n\n1) 400 – invalid amount\n    (0 or negative XP)\n2) 404 – butterfly not found\n    (not created)\n    → checked on PATCH (feed)",
      "originalText": "Errors – best practice:\nvalidate data first,\nthen check if it exists\n\n1) 400 – invalid amount\n    (0 or negative XP)\n2) 404 – butterfly not found\n    (not created)\n    → checked on PATCH (feed)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rectangle7",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
